{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "name": "TFT parallel demo",
  "description": "A MCUFRIEND 3.5\" shield (ILI9481, 320 x 480) on its 8-bit parallel bus, wired as on the Uno: RD A0, WR A1, RS A2, CS A3, RESET A4, D0-D7 on D8, D9, D2-D7. With tft_parallel.hex the controller is initialised and a window of four colour quadrants is painted.",
